{"seq":2,"slug":"creator-economy-platforms","title":"创作者经济平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/emerging-models/creator-economy-platforms","wordCount":2115,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"创作者经济平台\">创作者经济平台</h1><h2 id=\"注意力作为生产要素-创作者平台的经济学\">注意力作为生产要素：创作者平台的经济学</h2><p>创作者经济（creator economy）平台——YouTube、TikTok、Instagram、Twitch、Patreon、Substack——构成了一类特殊的双边市场：一侧是内容创作者（供给），另一侧是消费者/观众（需求），平台通过算法推荐进行匹配并从交互中抽取价值。</p>\n<p>与传统的商品双边市场不同，创作者平台的&quot;商品&quot;是<strong>注意力</strong>——一种不可存储、高度竞争、且质量评估极度主观的资源。创作者生产内容以竞争观众的注意力，平台则将注意力&quot;打包&quot;出售给广告主或通过订阅/打赏直接变现。</p>\n<p>2026 年全球创作者经济规模已达约 3130 亿美元（Goldman Sachs 预测 2027 年 TAM 达 4800 亿），约 5000 万人全球自认为职业或半职业创作者。但分配极度不均：前 1% 的创作者获取了 97% 的平台来源收入——这一数字比任何传统行业的收入集中度都高。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>创作者经济</strong>：以注意力为核心商品的内容双边市场，2026 年规模约 3130 亿美元</li>\n<li><strong>分成机制</strong>（Revenue Share）：平台与创作者分配收入的比例设计</li>\n<li><strong>注意力幂律分布</strong>：前 1% 创作者获取 97% 平台收入的极度集中结构</li>\n<li><strong>内容跑步机</strong>（Content Treadmill）：算法奖励持续产出迫使创作者不间断生产</li>\n<li><strong>平台议价力</strong>：取决于平台带来的增量观众 vs 创作者自带的核心粉丝之比</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"平台分成模型对比\">平台分成模型对比</h2><p>创作者与平台之间的核心经济关系体现在<strong>分成机制</strong>（revenue share）的设计上：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>分成模式</th>\n<th>创作者份额</th>\n<th>计量基础</th>\n<th>2026 千次观看收入 (RPM)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>YouTube 长视频</td>\n<td>广告收入分成</td>\n<td>55%</td>\n<td>广告展示+点击</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>20（中位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>6）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>YouTube Shorts</td>\n<td>广告池分享</td>\n<td>45%</td>\n<td>观看占比</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.03</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.03-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.03</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>0.10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TikTok 创作者奖励</td>\n<td>固定池分配</td>\n<td>非透明</td>\n<td>合格观看（&gt;1min视频）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.40</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.40-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.40</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>1.00</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TikTok 原创作者基金（已关闭）</td>\n<td>固定池分配</td>\n<td>非透明</td>\n<td>观看量</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.02</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.02-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.02</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>0.04</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Instagram Reels</td>\n<td>邀请制奖金</td>\n<td>非透明</td>\n<td>播放量（仅部分创作者）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.01</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.01-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>0.05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Twitch</td>\n<td>订阅分成</td>\n<td>50-70%</td>\n<td>订阅者数</td>\n<td>不适用（订阅制）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Patreon</td>\n<td>订阅分成</td>\n<td>88-95%</td>\n<td>月费</td>\n<td>不适用（订阅制）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Substack</td>\n<td>订阅分成</td>\n<td>90%</td>\n<td>付费订阅</td>\n<td>不适用（订阅制）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"分成率的经济学决定因素\">分成率的经济学决定因素</h3><p>平台的最优分成率取决于其<strong>外部选择数量</strong>（创作者是否有替代平台）和<strong>网络效应归属</strong>（价值主要来自平台还是创作者）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>平台议价力</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mtext>平台带来的增量观众</mtext><mtext>创作者自带的核心粉丝</mtext></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{平台议价力} = f\\left(\\frac{\\text{平台带来的增量观众}}{\\text{创作者自带的核心粉丝}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">平台议价力</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">创作者自带的核心粉丝</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">平台带来的增量观众</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>YouTube 可以收取 45% 因为其搜索和推荐系统为创作者带来大量增量观众；Patreon 只收取 5-12% 因为观众是创作者自带的——平台只提供支付基础设施。这解释了为何创作者工具正在从&quot;分发平台&quot;（高抽成）向&quot;基础设施即服务&quot;（低抽成）迁移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"注意力经济的数学模型\">注意力经济的数学模型</h2><p>创作者在有限的总注意力池中竞争。设平台上有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个创作者，总可用注意力时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>（用户总使用时长），创作者 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 获得的注意力份额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>γ</mi></msubsup><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>γ</mi></msubsup></mrow></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>其中 </mtext><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> 为内容质量信号</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_i = \\frac{q_i^{\\gamma}}{\\sum_{j=1}^N q_j^{\\gamma}} \\quad \\text{其中 } q_i \\text{ 为内容质量信号}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7663em;vertical-align:-1.307em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4593em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1288em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7823em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.413em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7823em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.307em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">其中</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">为内容质量信号</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>算法集中度</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时，算法放大质量差异（&quot;赢家通吃&quot;注意力分配）；当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时，算法平滑分配（&quot;长尾&quot;友好）。平台通过调整 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 来平衡&quot;头部内容吸引用户&quot;和&quot;长尾创作者留存&quot;之间的目标。</p>\n<h3 id=\"创作者收入的幂律分布\">创作者收入的幂律分布</h3><p>注意力份额的竞争性分配加上分成机制产生了创作者收入的<strong>幂律分布</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>收入</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></msup><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>其中 </mtext><mi>α</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{收入} &gt; x) \\propto x^{-\\alpha} \\quad \\text{其中 } \\alpha \\approx 1.2-1.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">收入</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">其中</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这意味着前 1% 创作者的收入是后 50% 创作者收入总和的数十倍。2026 年数据：YouTube 创作者项目累计支付超过 700 亿美元，但 50% 的创作者年收入低于 5000 美元。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[创作者收入来源结构 2026] --&gt; B[平台广告分成: 23%]&#10;    A --&gt; C[品牌赞助: 16%]&#10;    A --&gt; D[粉丝订阅/打赏: 19%]&#10;    A --&gt; E[商品销售: 12%]&#10;    A --&gt; F[课程/数字产品: 14%]&#10;    A --&gt; G[社交电商佣金: 10%]&#10;    A --&gt; H[创作者工具生态: 6%]&#10;    B --&gt; I[&quot;占比最大但增速放缓&lt;br&gt;受广告市场周期影响&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; J[&quot;增长最快 +31% YoY&lt;br&gt;Patreon/YouTube会员/TikTok礼物&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; K[&quot;新兴渠道&lt;br&gt;TikTok Shop 2025 Q4&lt;br&gt;单季支付12亿美元佣金&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[创作者收入来源结构 2026] --&gt; B[平台广告分成: 23%]\n    A --&gt; C[品牌赞助: 16%]\n    A --&gt; D[粉丝订阅/打赏: 19%]\n    A --&gt; E[商品销售: 12%]\n    A --&gt; F[课程/数字产品: 14%]\n    A --&gt; G[社交电商佣金: 10%]\n    A --&gt; H[创作者工具生态: 6%]\n    B --&gt; I[\"占比最大但增速放缓&lt;br&gt;受广告市场周期影响\"]\n    D --&gt; J[\"增长最快 +31% YoY&lt;br&gt;Patreon/YouTube会员/TikTok礼物\"]\n    G --&gt; K[\"新兴渠道&lt;br&gt;TikTok Shop 2025 Q4&lt;br&gt;单季支付12亿美元佣金\"]</pre><h2 id=\"平台-创作者博弈\">平台-创作者博弈</h2><p>创作者与平台之间存在持续的<strong>分配博弈</strong>——关于&quot;价值归谁&quot;的竞争。平台的杠杆是算法分发权（控制曝光）和支付基础设施；创作者的杠杆是内容供给和粉丝忠诚度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"平台的策略\">平台的策略</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>算法不透明</strong>：通过不公开推荐逻辑保持对创作者的信息不对称优势</li>\n<li><strong>基金池设计</strong>：使用固定池而非按比例分成，使池被稀释时创作者无法追责（TikTok 原创基金的核心设计缺陷）</li>\n<li><strong>格式引导</strong>：通过差异化激励引导创作者采用平台偏好的内容格式（如 YouTube 推 Shorts、TikTok 推长视频）</li>\n<li><strong>排他条款</strong>：部分平台要求创作者签署排他协议（限制多平台发布）</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"创作者的反策略\">创作者的反策略</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>多平台分发</strong>：降低对单一平台的依赖（2026 年跨平台工具如 ShortSync 的兴起）</li>\n<li><strong>私域流量</strong>：将粉丝导向自有渠道（邮件列表、Discord 社区）</li>\n<li><strong>集体行动</strong>：创作者工会/行会（如 YouTube 创作者签署公开信要求分成透明）</li>\n<li><strong>直接变现</strong>：绕过平台分成，通过 Patreon/Gumroad/自有网站直接向粉丝收费</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"tiktok-从基金到奖励计划的转型\">TikTok 从基金到奖励计划的转型</h2><p>TikTok 的变现模式演化是理解创作者平台经济学的绝佳案例：</p>\n<p><strong>旧模式（Creator Fund，2020-2023）</strong>：2 亿美元初始池，按观看量分配。问题：池固定但创作者增长，人均回报从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.04</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>千次降至</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.04/千次降至</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.04/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">千次降至</span></span></span></span></span>0.02/千次——&quot;分蛋糕的人越多，每块越小&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>新模式（Creativity Program，2023-现在）</strong>：只对 &gt;1 分钟视频分成，RPM 提升至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.40</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.40-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.40</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>1.00/千次。激励创作者从短视频转向中长视频（3-8 分钟），因为更长内容可以插入更多广告——2026 年 Nielsen 数据显示美国 TikTok 用时中 41% 已花在 3-8 分钟视频上。</p>\n<p><strong>社交电商层（TikTok Shop，2023-现在）</strong>：创作者通过带货赚取 5-20% 销售佣金。这彻底改变了变现结构——从&quot;注意力→广告收入→分成&quot;转向&quot;注意力→直接销售→佣金&quot;。2025 年 Q4 TikTok Shop 单季支付了 12 亿美元创作者佣金。</p>\n<h2 id=\"创作者经济的结构性问题\">创作者经济的结构性问题</h2><h3 id=\"内容过剩与注意力稀缺\">内容过剩与注意力稀缺</h3><p>当创作者供给过剩而观众注意力有限时，<a href=\"../foundations/network-effects-dynamics\">网络效应</a>中描述的&quot;拥堵效应&quot;在内容市场表现得尤为明显——更多创作者意味着单个创作者获得的平均曝光更少。</p>\n<h3 id=\"内容跑步机-困境\">&quot;内容跑步机&quot;困境</h3><p>平台算法奖励持续产出的创作者（最近 30 天内的表现决定未来推荐权重），这迫使创作者陷入不间断的生产循环。经济学上这类似于&quot;红皇后竞赛&quot;——为了留在原地也必须全力奔跑。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ai-对创作者供给侧的冲击\">AI 对创作者供给侧的冲击</h3><p>2025-2026 年生成式 AI 工具使得内容创作的边际成本趋近于零。AI 可以批量生产文章、视频脚本、甚至合成视频——这对人类创作者构成直接的供给侧竞争。平台面临选择：是允许 AI 内容涌入（增加总内容量但稀释人类创作者收入），还是限制 AI 内容（维持人类创作者生态但可能牺牲内容多样性）。</p>\n<p>这一问题将在<a href=\"ai-platform-economics\">AI 平台经济学</a>中结合 AI marketplace 的分析进一步展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>创作者经济平台是以注意力为稀缺资源的特殊双边市场，其收入分配遵循极端幂律分布。平台通过分成率设计和算法控制与创作者进行持续的价值分配博弈。TikTok 从基金到奖励计划再到社交电商的演化展示了平台如何通过变现模式创新重塑创作者行为。AI 生成内容对人类创作者的供给侧冲击正在改变竞争格局，使&quot;领域专知+受众信任&quot;成为人类创作者的核心竞争优势。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"创作者经济平台","id":"创作者经济平台"},{"level":2,"text":"注意力作为生产要素：创作者平台的经济学","id":"注意力作为生产要素-创作者平台的经济学"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"平台分成模型对比","id":"平台分成模型对比"},{"level":3,"text":"分成率的经济学决定因素","id":"分成率的经济学决定因素"},{"level":2,"text":"注意力经济的数学模型","id":"注意力经济的数学模型"},{"level":3,"text":"创作者收入的幂律分布","id":"创作者收入的幂律分布"},{"level":2,"text":"平台-创作者博弈","id":"平台-创作者博弈"},{"level":3,"text":"平台的策略","id":"平台的策略"},{"level":3,"text":"创作者的反策略","id":"创作者的反策略"},{"level":2,"text":"TikTok 从基金到奖励计划的转型","id":"tiktok-从基金到奖励计划的转型"},{"level":2,"text":"创作者经济的结构性问题","id":"创作者经济的结构性问题"},{"level":3,"text":"内容过剩与注意力稀缺","id":"内容过剩与注意力稀缺"},{"level":3,"text":"\"内容跑步机\"困境","id":"内容跑步机-困境"},{"level":3,"text":"AI 对创作者供给侧的冲击","id":"ai-对创作者供给侧的冲击"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"零工经济与劳动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/emerging-models/gig-economy-labor"},"next":{"title":"AI 平台经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/modern-platform-economics/emerging-models/ai-platform-economics"}}